/target

# Built WebAssembly components: generated at build time by the build scripts
# (`scripts/build-components.sh` and `scripts/build-cli-fixture-plugin.sh`, driven
# from `crates/backupcrawl-host/build.rs` and `crates/backupcrawl-cli/build.rs`).
# They are not committed. The tiny 8-byte discovery fixtures under
# `*/tests/fixtures/plugins/**/*.wasm` are hand-written source and stay tracked.
plugins/*/dist/*.wasm
crates/backupcrawl-host/tests/fixtures/test-detector.wasm
crates/backupcrawl-cli/tests/fixtures/detectors/dotbak/dotbak.wasm

# Generated by `cargo component` from the `wit` symlink; not source.
crates/backupcrawl-wit/src/bindings.rs
crates/test-components/src/bindings.rs
crates/backupcrawl-plugin-sdk/example-plugin/src/bindings.rs
plugins/*/src/bindings.rs

# Python bytecode from the developer scripts.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
